"P3017666332" "The doctors over at Chiron Medical Center want some more data on these mysterious Lost. If we can find out what has happened to those homeless people, we may be able to help them. I need you to hit the streets and defeat a few Lost.</a> Take some blood samples, then bring the data back to me."
